{"id":"9a2a77b262fcc8b1bd541cbe8e2eeeb62e95f891","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246384","title":"Sol-6.1 效率如何","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"mikifuns","excerpt":"OpenAI - @mikifuns - 大家体感 Sol-6.1 效率如何？ Sol-6.1 应付我的需求足够了，但是感觉无敌的慢，还是开了 fast 的情况下仍然慢的眼前一黑； Astra 虽然贵但是 fast 开的是真的 fast ，肉","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>大家体感 Sol-6.1 效率如何？ Sol-6.1 应付我的需求足够了，但是感觉无敌的慢，还是开了 fast 的情况下仍然慢的眼前一黑； Astra 虽然贵但是 fast 开的是真的 fast ，肉眼可见的速度效率提升了、、、不知道是 Sol 刚出容量不够还是本身模型的调教上就有点过于保守干活墨迹...</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/效率\"><li></li> 效率</a><a href=\"/tag/速度\"><li></li> 速度</a><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a></P><p><span>15 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-05 14:01:24 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147907\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dc2/c207/250207_normal.png?m=1503395374\" alt=\"zong89\" data-uid=\"250207\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zong89\">zong89</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 17:57:44 +08:00\">20h 20m ago via iPhone</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>为什么我还没有 6.1</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147925\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ef70/e688/439329_normal.png?m=1765364677\" alt=\"catwalk\" data-uid=\"439329\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/catwalk\">catwalk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 18:17:24 +08:00\">20h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>刚推出的时候很快，现在不仅降智，削减额度，还非常慢，把用户耍猴，不续费 chatgpt 了，还是用 claude</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147984\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/52ed27731df9ed6e21ea6c4a73c29f15?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"FlashEcho\" data-uid=\"618511\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/FlashEcho\">FlashEcho</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 19:07:43 +08:00\">19h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我在网页端的 Work 里用体感速度正常，刚去 OpenRouter 上看了一下，GPT6.1-SOL 和 6-Astra 的速度都有 40 多 tps 。感觉应该是正常的，不知道你那里是不是黑号了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148100\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1a77/befc/4768_normal.png?m=1752463987\" alt=\"levn\" data-uid=\"4768\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/levn\">levn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 21:10:11 +08:00\">17h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就智力和速度而言，它就像一个拿来应急的 astra slow</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148111\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e4f76d978d9101f1302ad00d4c609fa7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"craftsmanship\" data-uid=\"728583\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/craftsmanship\">craftsmanship</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 21:19:13 +08:00\">16h 59m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>正在用 挺慢的。。。感觉 opus5.5 很快 Sol6.1 总以为卡住了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148120\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b126/077d/77662_normal.png?m=1633133126\" alt=\"msdx123\" data-uid=\"77662\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msdx123\">msdx123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 21:28:05 +08:00\">16h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Sol 6.1 High 大概 30-40tps 。跟#5 提到的 OpenRouter 的数据一样，开 Fast 大概 60 。感觉速度挺正常的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148214\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3535e890dad8960697c4f90990c8dca7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"raycool\" data-uid=\"135320\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/raycool\">raycool</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 22:19:59 +08:00\">15h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在 gui 下用感觉很慢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148223\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/41b2/8a11/111446_normal.png?m=1755494923\" alt=\"ThisDay\" data-uid=\"111446\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ThisDay\">ThisDay</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 22:24:48 +08:00\">15h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>智力还可以，但是慢到令人发指</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148299\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1c0a3c64d916c64565a63c17b41f9680?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mikifuns\" data-uid=\"237094\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mikifuns\">mikifuns</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 23:38:39 +08:00\">14h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/FlashEcho\">FlashEcho</a> 按理说不应该呀。我用量本来也不大也没什么违规，完全就是月供一个祖宗的状态。</p><p>它也不是一直都很慢，有些任务它几十秒一两分钟就能干完，有些觉得很简单的又反而思考了很久，不是不吐出而是把简单的东西搞得复杂了，再加上突出慢一下。最开始我也以为是不吐出后来发现是 GUI 折叠的太彻底了实际上在干活。hmmmm<br>反正这个效率跟速度是挺迷的现在</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148312\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cba2/dc20/87080_normal.png?m=1790648006\" alt=\"ysicing\" data-uid=\"87080\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ysicing\">ysicing</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 23:54:29 +08:00\">14h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只是 fast ，不然慢的可怕</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148359\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ebea/d1b0/254966_normal.png?m=1779740858\" alt=\"noahhhh\" data-uid=\"254966\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/noahhhh\">noahhhh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 01:01:40 +08:00\">13h 16m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉像以前的 GPT 5.5 ，很慢，但是额度烧的也少，一晚上才 10%，同样活 Astra 两天不到就吃完了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18148981\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da7d/fb92/754606_normal.png?m=1789721027\" alt=\"mathiashu4\" data-uid=\"754606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mathiashu4\">mathiashu4</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-05 14:01:24 +08:00\">16 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>做了下对比，6.1SOL 输出确实比 Astra 中慢一点，输出的质量差不多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"大家体感 Sol-6.1 效率如何？ Sol-6.1 应付我的需求足够了，但是感觉无敌的慢，还是开了 fast 的情况下仍然慢的眼前一黑； Astra 虽然贵但是 fast 开的是真的 fast ，肉眼可见的速度效率提升了、、、不知道是 Sol 刚出容量不够还是本身模型的调教上就有点过于保守干活墨迹... 效率 速度 模型15 replies • 2026-10-05 14:01:24 +08:00 1 zong89 20h 20m ago via iPhone 1 为什么我还没有 6.1 3 catwalk 20h 0m ago 刚推出的时候很快，现在不仅降智，削减额度，还非常慢，把用户耍猴，不续费 chatgpt 了，还是用 claude 5 FlashEcho 19h 